  "description": {
    "raw": "Driving sleet blocks all sight (even darkvision) within it and causes the ground in the area to be icy. A creature can walk within or through the area of sleet at half normal speed with a DC 10 Acrobatics check. Failure means it can't move in that round, while failure by 5 or more means it falls (see the Acrobatics skill for details).\n\nThe sleet extinguishes torches and small fires.",
    "search_text": "\"driving sleet blocks all sight (even darkvision) within it and causes the ground in the area to be icy. a creature can walk within or through the area of sleet at half normal speed with a dc 10 acrobatics check. failure means it can't move in that round, while failure by 5 or more means it falls (see the acrobatics skill for details).\\n\\nthe sleet extinguishes torches and small fires.\"",
    "sections": []
